{title: Laakhon Hai Nigaah Mein}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi O P Nayyar}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C],        Lakhon hain nigahon mein
[C],        Zindagi ki raahon mein
[C] [G],        Sanam haseen jawaan
[D],        Hothon mein gulaab hai
[D],        Aankhon mein sharaab hai
[D] [C],        Lekin woh baat kahan
[C],        Latt hai kisi ki jaadu ka jaal
[G],        Rang daale dil pe Kisi ka jamaal
[F],        Tauba ye nigahein ki rokti hain raahe
[F] [G] [C],        Dekho le leke teer kamaan
[C] [F],        Jaanu na dewana main dil ka
[F] [G] [C],        Kaun hai khayalon ki malika
[C],        Bheegi Bheegi Rut ki Chhaon tale
[G] [F],        Maan lo kahin wo aa na mile
[F],        Kaise pehchaun ke naam nahi jaanu
[F] [G] [C],        Jise dhunde mere armaan hai
